01:07:57,134 --> 01:07:58,074
So, is there, is everyone familiar

1586
01:07:58,074 --> 01:07:59,014
with what a click-through rate is?

1587
01:07:59,134 --> 01:08:00,774
No. Not everyone.

1588
01:08:00,774 --> 01:08:03,874
Okay. So this is just a simple ratio.

1589
01:08:03,874 --> 01:08:07,354
It's, let's say you show an ad some number

1590
01:08:07,354 --> 01:08:10,354
of times to users on the Internet.

1591
01:08:10,354 --> 01:08:12,654
It's the ratio of the number of

1592
01:08:12,654 --> 01:08:14,954
times a user clicks on that ad

1593
01:08:14,954 --> 01:08:17,234
to the total number of times you showed it.

1594
01:08:17,234 --> 01:08:18,964
So if you show an ad

1595
01:08:18,964 --> 01:08:20,694
100 times and you get one click,

1596
01:08:20,694 --> 01:08:23,413
you have a 1% click-through rate.

1597
01:08:23,413 --> 01:08:29,093
And if you think about, well, why are people advertising?

1598
01:08:29,093 --> 01:08:31,734
In marketing, there's kind of this concept of this marketing

1599
01:08:31,734 --> 01:08:35,014
funnel, which is a little bit silly, but it actually

1600
01:08:35,014 --> 01:08:36,893
conveys a useful concept.

1601
01:08:36,893 --> 01:08:38,913
Up here is kind of like everyone in the world.

1602
01:08:38,913 --> 01:08:40,993
And then here is the people we can actually make

1603
01:08:40,993 --> 01:08:42,413
aware of our product.

1604
01:08:42,413 --> 01:08:44,113
Then here is the people who

1605
01:08:44,113 --> 01:08:45,813
we can actually have an affinity

1606
01:08:45,813 --> 01:08:46,794
for our product.

1607
01:08:46,794 --> 01:08:50,153
And here is the people who we can actually consider

1608
01:08:50,153 --> 01:08:51,393
purchasing our product.

1609
01:08:51,393 --> 01:08:52,874
And then people who actually buy it.

1610
01:08:52,874 --> 01:08:55,094
And then repeat loyal customers who buy it more and

1611
01:08:55,094 --> 01:08:57,634
more, so we get to a narrower and narrower pool.

1612
01:08:57,634 --> 01:08:58,754
And what marketers are kind

1613
01:08:58,754 --> 01:08:59,874
of constantly trying to do is

1614
01:08:59,874 --> 01:09:03,153
push people through this funnel so they can actually

1615
01:09:03,153 --> 01:09:04,173
start with someone who may not

1616
01:09:04,173 --> 01:09:05,193
know about the product at all

1617
01:09:05,193 --> 01:09:06,483
and then actually get them

1618
01:09:06,483 --> 01:09:07,773
to buy it again and again.

1619
01:09:07,773 --> 01:09:10,493
And so marketers use a variety of different tools.

1620
01:09:10,493 --> 01:09:13,834
Online advertising is one, but that represents maybe 15% of

1621
01:09:13,834 --> 01:09:15,874
the market, but it's a relatively new one.

1622
01:09:15,874 --> 01:09:18,394
And there's plenty of others that go back decades or

1623
01:09:18,394 --> 01:09:22,693
centuries, things like television, radio, print.

1624
01:09:22,693 --> 01:09:25,433
And these different media play different roles in getting

1625
01:09:25,433 --> 01:09:27,754
people through this marketing funnel.

1626
01:09:27,754 --> 01:09:31,334
And if you think about where online advertising originally

1627
01:09:31,334 --> 01:09:33,104
grew up, it was really towards

1628
01:09:33,104 --> 01:09:34,874
the very bottom of this funnel

1629
01:09:34,874 --> 01:09:37,473
of, OK, I am looking for a

1630
01:09:37,473 --> 01:09:40,073
blue iPod at the best price that I

1631
01:09:40,073 --> 01:09:41,913
can either order online or that it's within

1632
01:09:41,913 --> 01:09:42,893
five miles of my home.

1633
01:09:42,893 --> 01:09:44,973
So I search that on a search engine.

1634
01:09:44,973 --> 01:09:46,794
I see a list of vendors.

1635
01:09:46,794 --> 01:09:49,633
And in that case, it's really important whether I click

1636
01:09:49,633 --> 01:09:52,473
through, because that's basically the determinant of

1637
01:09:52,693 --> 01:09:53,843
whether or not we get them

1638
01:09:53,843 --> 01:09:54,994
through the next stage in the

1639
01:09:54,994 --> 01:09:56,073
marketing funnel.

1640
01:09:56,073 --> 01:09:58,693
If you think about Facebook advertising, that is one of

1641
01:09:58,693 --> 01:10:00,334
the roles that it can play.

1642
01:10:00,334 --> 01:10:02,874
But it can also actually play throughout this entire

1643
01:10:02,874 --> 01:10:05,773
marketing funnel, where we have a reach of 500 million

1644
01:10:05,773 --> 01:10:08,393
people, and then you can target within that.

1645
01:10:08,393 --> 01:10:09,773
And then you can use

1646
01:10:09,773 --> 01:10:11,153
things like social context telling you

1647
01:10:11,153 --> 01:10:12,363
that your friend might really

1648
01:10:12,363 --> 01:10:13,574
love a product to help build

1649
01:10:13,574 --> 01:10:16,694
your affinity for it on through this whole funnel.

1650
01:10:16,694 --> 01:10:18,074
So for some of it, click-through rate is

1651
01:10:18,074 --> 01:10:18,633
relevant.

1652
01:10:18,633 --> 01:10:21,214
For other of it, click-through rate really isn't relevant.

1653
01:10:21,214 --> 01:10:22,654
And you need to think about other sorts

1654
01:10:22,654 --> 01:10:25,553
of measurement, things like companies like Nielsen do,

1655
01:10:25,553 --> 01:10:27,483
like polling people and asking

1656
01:10:27,483 --> 01:10:29,414
them, OK, you saw this media.

1657
01:10:29,414 --> 01:10:32,174
Did it increase your likelihood to buy this product?

1658
01:10:32,174 --> 01:10:33,564
Or did it make you aware

1659
01:10:33,564 --> 01:10:34,954
of the message that the brand's

1660
01:10:34,954 --> 01:10:37,174
trying to convey that you weren't aware of before?

1661
01:10:37,174 --> 01:10:38,674
I think it's one of a number

1662
01:10:38,674 --> 01:10:40,174
of metrics that kind of go into

1663
01:10:40,174 --> 01:10:43,053
assessing the health of the business as a whole.

1664
01:10:43,053 --> 01:10:45,013
I think we're essentially out of time.

1665
01:10:45,013 --> 01:10:48,353
But let me just say, click-through rates and

1666
01:10:48,353 --> 01:10:52,374
marketing sound like profit-oriented.

1667
01:10:52,374 --> 01:10:55,434
But it seems to me they have a social purpose.

1668
01:10:55,434 --> 01:10:58,514
One thing is that capitalism is being transformed by this

1669
01:10:58,514 --> 01:11:00,143
kind of thing, because it gets

1670
01:11:00,143 --> 01:11:01,773
people to buy things that they

1671
01:11:01,773 --> 01:11:02,273
really need.

1672
01:11:02,273 --> 01:11:07,294
It's like your StrengthsFinder or NeedsFinder.

1673
01:11:07,294 --> 01:11:10,934
And I have to applaud Facebook and other companies.

1674
01:11:10,934 --> 01:11:12,804
Finally, I'm going to invite

1675
01:11:12,804 --> 01:11:14,674
you back in another 10 years.

1676
01:11:14,674 --> 01:11:16,494
This was great.

1677
01:11:16,494 --> 01:11:17,794
Thanks.

